-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Gadgetbridge
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Nimrag Connect ports code and definitions from Gadgetbridge, the free and
open-source app for wearables that works without the vendors' cloud:

  https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge
  Copyright (C) the Gadgetbridge contributors (see CONTRIBUTORS.rst in the
  Gadgetbridge repository)
  Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3 or later.

Ported work is based on Gadgetbridge commit
7257742b96a30fff0db9e79230435ac2aeb39f57 (2026-11-18). Every ported file
names its Gadgetbridge source file(s) and keeps the original copyright
lines in its header, and docs/PORTED.md lists each one. Gadgetbridge's
artwork (LICENSE.artwork, CC BY-SA 4.0) is not used.

Thank you to everyone who built Gadgetbridge. Years of careful work on
Garmin devices made it possible for Nimrag Connect to support wearables
without decoding every one of them from scratch.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Open-Meteo
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

The optional weather feature gets its forecasts from Open-Meteo
(https://open-meteo.com). Weather data by Open-Meteo.com, licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). No Open-Meteo data is
redistributed with this program; it is fetched at run time by the user's
own server.

